From 96fe22e02daffe893e4b4ccad499281556b44177 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dylandoesprogramming664 <dylan20xx@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Jan 2026 11:55:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Trainer and PKMN edits

Repo Changes:
- Added log files to the `.gitignore`

GFX Changes:
- Slightly modified title screen for Pokemon Yellow Remix

Gameplay Changes:
- Starting Pikachu gets perfect DVs
- Fossils are revived at LVL 39

Overworld Changes:
- Moved one of the trainers on Route 3 down one tile; results in a
  glitch where the trainer walks through a cliff to start a battle,
  which is hilarious

Trainer Changes:
- Added myself as a trainer to fight in the post game
- Buffs to trainer parties
- Created some new Victory Road trainers yet to be named and added into the game
- Lt. Surge's RAICHU is now LVL 30

Shop Changes:
- All TMs now cost 1000 yen

Move Changes (Base/Legacy):
- SUBMISSION is now 90 power (+10/+10)
- MEGA_DRAIN is now 60 power (+20/-5)
- RAGE is now a DRAGON move
- STRING_SHOT is now 100 accuracy (+5/+5)
- CUT is now a critical hit move like RAZOR_LEAF and SLASH
- TRANSFORM now gives 10 PP per stolen move (+5/+5)

Pokemon Changes:
- EKANS and ARBOK learn CONSTRICT at LVL 1
- Stat buffs to ZUBAT, MAGNEMITE, MAGNETON, DITTO, EEVEE, VAPOREON, JOLTEON, FLAREON
- GOLDUCK is now WATER/PSYCHIC type
- GYARADOS can now learn EARTHQUAKE
- Many minor moveset buffs

Miscellaneous Changes:
- Added a safety byte to wCutTrees

